                                                "sense_id": "1c6e0121-b58a-3072-8ad8-d9df3fae314a",
                                                "text": "Lady Bellaston fixed her eyes on Sophia whilst she spoke these words. To which that poor young lady, having her face overspread with blushes and confusion, answered, in a stammering voice […]"
